title: Drawers3B
---
// Talk target of the chest of drawers in 3B (Hotspots layer). Where the blush socks are
// is $r1_socks_at (drawers, box, rack, feet) while he isn't holding them: on moving day
// he puts them here or in the box, and on Sunday he can wear them or hang them on the rack
// (rack_3b.yarn). On the second Thursday they start on the rack, not here.
-> Put the blush socks away <<if $chapter == "R1MoveIn" and $gate_r1_move_box and $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "drawers">>
    <<set $r1_movein_socks to "drawers">>
    <<set $gate_r1_move_socks to true>>
    <<done R1MoveIn stow>>
    You: Top drawer. Next to the grey ones.
    <<if $gate_r1_move_rules>>
        <<note r1_move "Unpacked. Bed.">>
    <<else>>
        <<note r1_move "Answer the door.">>
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if $chapter == "R1Sunday" and not $gate_r1_sun_croissant and $r1_socks_at == "drawers">>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "feet">>
    <<done R1Breakfast wear>>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Look
    <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door>>
        // PLACEHOLDER lines.
        You: Not in the drawer. I washed them. They're drying somewhere.
        <<set $r1_thu2_socks_noted to true>>
        <<note thu2_socks "The socks?">>
    <<elseif $chapter == "R1Viewing">>
        You: Somebody's drawers. Empty.
    <<else>>
        You: Shirts, mostly grey. Socks, mostly grey.
    <<endif>>
===
